-- The ranges the property checks walk (MMS-775): a module's tests try a
-- rule on every case of a small grid and assert what holds across it, and
-- these grids were written out the same way in every module that needed
-- one. Each is declared here once and imported (IMPORT property_checks);
-- a grid that reads a module's own values stays in that module.

IMPORT prelude

`both booleans` MEANS LIST TRUE, FALSE
`tenths to 1.5` MEANS map (GIVEN k YIELD k DIVIDED BY 10) (range 0 15)
`hundredths to 1` MEANS map (GIVEN k YIELD k DIVIDED BY 100) (range 0 100)
`fifths to 1` MEANS map (GIVEN k YIELD k DIVIDED BY 5) (range 0 5)
`twelfths to 1.5` MEANS map (GIVEN k YIELD k DIVIDED BY 12) (range 0 18)
`hundredths to 1.5` MEANS map (GIVEN k YIELD k DIVIDED BY 100) (range 0 150)
